README.MD
SETUP:
Download code debian version from website

Open terminal, navigate to Downloads folder and run:
    sudo dpkg -i <package>

Install OpenCL and CMake requirements:
    sudo apt update
    sudo apt install build-essential cmake clinfo opencl-headers ocl-icd-opencl-dev
    sudo apt install pocl-opencl-icd
    sudo apt install g++ opencl-clhpp-headers
    sudo apt install intel-opencl-icd

Install YARA requirements:
    sudo apt install yara libyara-dev

Open VSCode
Login via Github
Clone repository "GPUScanner" into home directory of machine
Set global user.name and user.email:
    git config --global user.name "<name>"
    git config --global user.email "<email>"
